Z||000038||Cheever3000||10-17-2001||08:55 PM|||| <BLOCKQUOTE><font size="1" face="Verdana, Arial, Helvetica">quote:</font><HR>Originally posted by rockcrawl:<BR> You're kidding, right? Check out how well the door fits.... and the nice straight body line.... and the hood and headlights. I love the 100mph tape holding the mirror on!<BR><HR></BLOCKQUOTE>Oh yeah.  Well, my wife will vouch for the fact that I'm not very observant.  Plus the fact that you have an experienced eye for kits, where-az I be just a plain ol' country boy.  BTW, RC: did you sell your Lambo, is that right?  What projects take your time these days?  Your talents are too good to waste on mere transportation!<P>||||reg||1
